{"type":"text","timestamp":1771201768242,"sessionID":"ses_39c2bb03bffeUY5Iet1Cj0VNDG","part":{"id":"prt_c63da2b17001ThPhhKiKBv9gbe","sessionID":"ses_39c2bb03bffeUY5Iet1Cj0VNDG","messageID":"msg_c63da140e001nYOfviXomXKPs7","type":"text","text":"Now let me implement the next important feature: mobile gesture (triple-tap) for opening the settings panel. This is critical for mobile users.","time":{"start":1771201768237,"end":1771201768237}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771201812994,"sessionID":"ses_39c2bb03bffeUY5Iet1Cj0VNDG","part":{"id":"prt_c63da2b1f001DZZ42egznuD07n","sessionID":"ses_39c2bb03bffeUY5Iet1Cj0VNDG","messageID":"msg_c63da140e001nYOfviXomXKPs7","type":"tool","callID":"call_8a73dd0ba719441a88e40cb1","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore touch event patterns","prompt":"Search the codebase for any existing touch event handling patterns, particularly in CanvasGrid.tsx and GridInteraction.tsx. Look for touch event listeners, touch coordinate handling, and any gesture detection logic. I need to understand how to implement a triple-tap gesture detection in the top-left corner of the screen.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39c25d4ddffedZbpqBmpTKnRqJ (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\n## Summary of Touch Event Handling Patterns\n\nBased on my search of the codebase, here's what I found regarding touch event handling:\n\n### Existing Touch Event Handling\n\n#### 1. **CanvasGrid.tsx** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx`)\n- Line 27-31: Defines onClick and onMouseMove callbacks that accept both `React.MouseEvent<HTMLCanvasElement>` and `React.TouchEvent<HTMLCanvasElement>`\n- Line 211: Canvas has `touchAction: 'none'` to prevent default browser touch behaviors (scrolling, zooming)\n- Events are passed through without processing logic\n\n#### 2. **GridInteraction.tsx** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GridInteraction.tsx`)\n- Lines 126-138: `handleCanvasClick` processes both mouse and touch events\n- Lines 140-156: `handleCanvasMove` handles movement events\n- Both use `getCellFromEvent` from the interaction library to convert events to grid coordinates\n\n#### 3. **Interaction Library** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/interaction.ts`)\nThe core touch coordinate handling logic:\n\n```typescript\nexport function getCellFromEvent(\n  event: MouseEvent | TouchEvent,\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\n  numRows: number,\n  numCols: number\n): GridCoordinates {\n  const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect()\n  const scaleX = canvas.width / rect.width\n  const scaleY = canvas.height / rect.height\n\n  let clientX: number\n  let clientY: number\n\n  if (event instanceof MouseEvent) {\n    clientX = event.clientX\n    clientY = event.clientY\n  } else {\n    // Touch event handling\n    const touch = event.touches[0] || event.changedTouches[0]\n    clientX = touch.clientX\n    clientY = touch.clientY\n  }\n\n  const x = (clientX - rect.left) * scaleX\n  const y = (clientY - rect.top) * scaleY\n\n  return {\n    row: Math.floor(y / cellHeight),\n    col: Math.floor(x / cellWidth),\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Key patterns observed:**\n- Touch coordinates are extracted using `event.touches[0] || event.changedTouches[0]`\n- Canvas bounding rect is used to calculate relative coordinates\n- Device pixel ratio scaling is handled for high-DPI displays\n\n### No Existing Gesture Detection\n\nThe codebase **does not currently have any gesture detection logic**. There's no double-tap, swipe, pinch, or other multi-touch gesture handling.\n\n### Implementation Recommendations for Triple-Tap Detection\n\nFor implementing a triple-tap gesture in the top-left corner, here's the recommended approach:\n\n#### 1. **Coordinate Detection**\nYou'll need to check if touch coordinates are within a defined zone (e.g., top-left 100x100px):\n\n```typescript\nfunction isInTopLeftCorner(clientX: number, clientY: number, threshold: number = 100): boolean {\n  return clientX < threshold && clientY < threshold\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. **Triple-Tap Tracking Logic**\nSimilar to how `usePhaseTimer` and `useTransition` hooks manage state, you'll need:\n\n```typescript\ninterface TripleTapState {\n  tapCount: number\n  lastTapTime: number\n  tapCoordinates: { x: number; y: number } | null\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. **Recommended Implementation Approach**\n\nCreate a custom hook `useTripleTapGesture` that:\n- Listens for `touchstart` or `mousedown` events on a global or container level\n- Tracks tap timing (typically 300-500ms between taps)\n- Validates coordinate consistency (all taps in same corner zone)\n- Resets state if too much time passes between taps\n- Triggers a callback when triple-tap is detected\n\n#### 4. **Event Handling Pattern to Follow**\n\nBased on existing patterns in the codebase:\n- Use `useRef` for tracking timestamps to avoid re-renders\n- Use `useEffect` to attach/remove event listeners\n- Clean up timers with `clearTimeout` like in `useTransition.ts`\n- Handle `visibilitychange` events to manage state when tab is hidden\n\n### Files You Should Study\n\n1. **`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/interaction.ts`** - Core coordinate extraction logic\n2. **`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/usePhaseTimer.ts`** - Pattern for timer-based state management\n3. **`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTransition.ts`** - Pattern for timeout management and cleanup\n4. **`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx`** - Canvas touch event setup with `touchAction: 'none'`\n\n### Key Constants to Consider\n\nFrom `canvasUtils.ts`:\n- Mobile breakpoint: 768px (`window.innerWidth < 768`)\n- Responsive cell size: 18px (mobile) / 20px (desktop)\n- Consider making the triple-tap zone responsive to screen size\n\nWould you like me to provide a complete implementation of the `useTripleTapGesture` hook based on these patterns?\n</task_result>","title":"Explore touch event patterns","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39c25d4ddffedZbpqBmpTKnRqJ","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771201768225,"end":1771201812992}}}}
